      "id": 493696,
      "username": "Basant",
      "name": "Basant Choudhary",
      "created_at": "2026-02-07T21:17:32.667Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Why is Gstin not part of the dispatch address in the e-invoice? <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smit_vora\">@Smit_Vora</a> , can you check the below code? Is it intentional, and what’s the rationale?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/resilient-tech/india-compliance/blob/develop/india_compliance/gst_india/utils/e_invoice.py\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">india-compliance/india_compliance/gst_india/utils/e_invoice.py at develop · resilient-tech/india-compliance · GitHub</a> <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#L951</span></p>\n<p><code>if self.dispatch_address:</code><br>\n<code>invoice_data[“DispDtls”] = {</code><br>\n<code>“Nm”: self.dispatch_address.address_title,</code><br>\n<code>“Addr1”: self.dispatch_address.address_line1,</code><br>\n<code>“Addr2”: self.dispatch_address.address_line2,</code><br>\n<code>“Loc”: self.dispatch_address.city,</code><br>\n<code>“Pin”: self.dispatch_address.pincode,</code><br>\n<code>“Stcd”: self.dispatch_address.state_number,</code><br>\n<code>}</code></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/basant/{size}/35915_2.png",
