      "name": "Smit Vora",
      "created_at": "2026-02-08T05:02:10.808Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No way to submit GSTIN with dispatch address.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Others/BulkGenerationTools\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Others/BulkGenerationTools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">einvoice1.gst.gov.in</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Others/BulkGenerationTools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BulkGenerationTools - nic.einvoice.web</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/d/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/d/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84_2_690x369.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8Qizr70x4bwaxNu1jnFi1wpuG8c\" width=\"690\" height=\"369\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/d/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84_2_690x369.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/d/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84_2_1035x553.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/d/3dfad9ddaebae71deff8427d7597094970956d84_2_1380x738.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D0D0D2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1737×930 94 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
