    {
      "id": 493795,
      "username": "Basant",
      "name": "Basant Choudhary",
      "created_at": "2026-02-09T14:32:23.396Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smit_vora\">@Smit_Vora</a> . I noticed its a missing field on einvoice portal. Do you know how to generate einvoice+ewb for <em><span class=\"bbcode-u\">Bill From - Dispatch From</span></em> transaction type in erpnext? Can it happen in single call or will need a separate EWB generation? How do you prevent EWB generation initially?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/basant/{size}/35915_2.png",
