    {
      "id": 493878,
      "username": "Basant",
      "name": "Basant Choudhary",
      "created_at": "2026-02-10T08:30:55.180Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The funny thing is that official documentation on einvoice site still mention GSTIN as a param for dispatch details. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smit_vora\">@Smit_Vora</a> . When I tried it in postman, the GSTIN value was not returned with generate IRN response. So, they are ignoring the param at the server.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox pdf\" data-onebox-src=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Documents/E-INVOICE-SCHEMA.pdf\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Documents/E-INVOICE-SCHEMA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">einvoice1.gst.gov.in</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <a href=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Documents/E-INVOICE-SCHEMA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span class=\"pdf-onebox-logo\"></span></a>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Documents/E-INVOICE-SCHEMA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">E-INVOICE-SCHEMA.pdf</a></h3>\n\n  <p class=\"filesize\">145.34 KB</p>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/0/80be71d42ff7aa479afbd6095203dd2e31611162.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/80be71d42ff7aa479afbd6095203dd2e31611162\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/0/80be71d42ff7aa479afbd6095203dd2e31611162.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"imV8NN5TWhOxHgjCbXIEs8KDOwO\" width=\"491\" height=\"219\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">491×219 18.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"