      "id": 495645,
      "username": "Smit_Vora",
      "name": "Smit Vora",
      "created_at": "2026-03-09T05:53:34.676Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Happens in one call. It’s handled automatically based on address inputs provided.</p>\n<p>If you print e-Waybill for attachment - this may need one additional API Request (you can disable this from GST Settings). Otherwise generation of e-Invoice and e-Waybill can both be handled in one request.</p>",
